BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 563.75 Tm (written permission and a short notary meeting, with payment dependent on successful recovery. The shared) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 548.52 Tm (approach is information first, room for questions, and a manageable next action - not an instant demand for) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 533.30 Tm (trust [NOkg0U0k9Zs @ 00:00:11].) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 518.07 Tm (Credibility begins with identifying details the recipient can recognize. Alfred Taren wants the sale date, sale) Tj ET
